  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Two species of colonially nesting geese breed in the oil fields operated by BP on the North Slope: Black Brant (Branta bernicla nigricans) and Lesser Snow Geese (Chen caerulescens caerulescens). Since the mid-1980s, various monitoring programs have focused on both species. Long term observations for number of nests from Sagavanirktok River Delta, Niakuk Island, Surfcote, and Milne Point colonies."
